WEBVTT

00:00:28.613 --> 00:00:30.130
To mi je posao.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.340
Jedan sam od šačice ljudi

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.454
koji se strašno iznervira

00:00:34.454 --> 00:00:37.048
lošim razmakom između T i E

00:00:37.048 --> 00:00:38.948
koji ovde vidite.

00:00:38.948 --> 00:00:40.390
Moram da sklonim ovaj slajd.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:42.461
Ne mogu da ga podnesem. A ni Kris.

00:00:42.461 --> 00:00:44.122
Tako. Dobro.

00:00:44.122 --> 00:00:45.890
Moj govor je o vezi

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:49.290
između tehnologije i dizajna slova.

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:51.953
Tehnologija se promenila

00:00:51.953 --> 00:00:54.825
nekoliko puta otkad sam počeo da radim:

00:00:54.825 --> 00:00:59.486
foto, digitalno, desktop,
monitor, internet.

00:00:59.486 --> 00:01:01.224
Morao sam da preživim
te promene i